invalid type: string "SECTION 47. ADJUSTER RECOMMENDATION AND SIGN-OFF\n\nReview of the policy schedule confirms that coverage applicable to the adjuster recommendation and sign-off was in force at the date of loss, subject to the standard deductible of $27,650 and the sublimits set out in the declarations page. No endorsement affecting this coverage part was identified during the file review.ÿÿÿÿ